sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Person
    participant T as Telegram
    participant A as Authy
    participant N as MyNet
    participant F as MyFamily
    participant B as Browsy
    participant R as Peer
    P->>A: authenticate Telegram
    A->>T: challenge
    T-->>A: presence + id
    Note over A: L2 presence · no @handle public
    A->>N: enable MyNet
    Note over N: people · circles · feed
    N->>F: simplified record
    F-->>N: person + relation + traits + affinity
    N->>B: save class L
    Note over B: local federation
    B-->>R: encrypted L projection
    alt claim Telegram
        P->>A: open claim nonce
        A->>T: deep link + DM
        T-->>A: id == id
        Note over A: L3 verified · public publish
    else no Telegram
        N-->>P: MyNet stays locked
    end
